	  Option2  Luck option rolls    (Rate0-1,  on/off)
	  Option3  JoL option rolls     (Rate0-7,  8 possible tiers)
	  Option4  Excellent option roll count (Rate0-6, 0-6 exc options)
	  Option5  Set option rolls     (Rate0-2,  0-2 set slots)
	  Option6  Socket option roll count (Rate0-5, 0-5 sockets)

	Within each group:
	Index       Roll-context ID. 0=Common drop, 1=Excellent-item drop,
	            2=Set-item drop, 3-8=various mix/combine results,
	            9=MossMerchant, 10=Lucky item, 11+=EventItemBag tiers
	            (see ItemOptionRate.h enum-equivalent comments).
	RateN       Weight out of 10000 for outcome N. All RateN for a
	            given Index should sum to 10000 (0 = impossible).
	Comment     Free-text label, for readability only.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

